<title>SWEDEN: Sweden sets auction of 4.5 bln Skr worth of T-bill.</title>
<headline>Sweden sets auction of 4.5 bln Skr worth of T-bill.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sweden's National Debt Office said on Tuesday it would invite bids from the market for an auction of Treasury bills.</p>
<p>The auction will take place on May 14 it said and bids are due by 1030 GMT next Tuesday. Settlement date is May 16.  MATURITY DATE		ISSUE VOLUME	    NUMBER OF DAYS</p>
<p> Aug 20, 1997		 500 million crowns	    94</p>
<p> Nov 19, 1997		 4.0 bln crowns	    183</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700-1017</p>
</text>
